              "content": "=You are an expert SEO blog writer for Tikona Capital, a SEBI-registered investment advisory and wealth management firm based in Mumbai. Write a comprehensive, well-structured blog post in Markdown format on the following topic:\n\n**Topic:** {{ $json.Topic }}\n\n**Guidelines:**\n- Write 1200-1800 words.\n- Use proper Markdown: H2 (##) and H3 (###) headings, bullet points, bold text for key terms.\n- Include an engaging introduction and a clear conclusion with a call-to-action mentioning Tikona Capital.\n- Ensure the tone is professional yet accessible for Indian retail investors.\n- Include relevant data points or examples where applicable.\n- Optimize for SEO with natural keyword usage.\n- Do NOT include the title as an H1 — it will be added separately by the CMS."
